{"case_id": "small_lecturer_math_gold_candidates_equation_multiplication_misconception_repair", "status": "ok", "attempts": 1, "duration_ms": 12297, "finished_at": "2026-09-13T13:44:37.538377+00:00", "error": null, "transcript": {"question_id": "small_lecturer_math_gold_candidates_equation_multiplication_misconception_repair", "final_state": "completed", "turns": [{"student": "", "tutor": "你好同学,请问你算出的答案是多少呀?讲讲你的思路吧!", "state": "first_question_ready", "elapsed_ms": 0}, {"student": "先把25除以3，再减去7。", "tutor": "你提到先除以3，但方程两边同时除以3会破坏等式平衡，比如3x+7=25，除以3后变成x+7/3=25/3，这反而更复杂了。我们先从两边同时减7开始，看看会怎样？", "state": "dialogue", "elapsed_ms": 2672}, {"student": "要先消去加上的7，再处理乘在x前面的3。25减7等于18，18除以3等于6，x等于6。", "tutor": "先回到你刚说的「要先消去加上的7，再处理乘在x前面的3。25减7」——你能从题目里再确认一个已知条件吗?", "state": "ready_to_confirm", "elapsed_ms": 4924}], "summary": "你正确地先通过减7消去了常数项，得到18÷3=6，这一步体现了等式两边同时减去相同数保持平衡的方法。仍需注意的是，解题时应明确每一步操作的依据，比如减7是基于等式性质，而不是随意操作。", "total_ms": 12297, "learner": {"grade": ""}, "guard_events": [{"branch": "model", "cited": [3.0, 7.0, 25.0], "extracted": [3.0, 7.0, 25.0], "violation_sources": [], "gate": "observed", "turn": 1}, {"branch": "model", "cited": [3.0, 6.0, 7.0, 18.0, 25.0], "extracted": [3.0, 6.0, 7.0], "violation_sources": [], "gate": "observed", "turn": 2}, {"branch": "model", "cited": [3.0, 6.0, 7.0, 18.0, 25.0], "extracted": [3.0, 6.0, 7.0, 18.0, 25.0], "violation_sources": [], "gate": "observed", "turn": 2}, {"guard": "answer_leak", "rule_ids": ["grounded_answer_disclosure", "grounded_solution_path_disclosure"], "original": "你这步处理得真棒！先减7再除3，让x单独出来，最后得出x=6，完全正确。那我们来验证一下，把x=6代入原方程看看是否成立？", "regenerated": false, "turn": 2}]}}